[h2]0.8.2[/h2]
[h3]Water looks right again[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Water is blue again.[/b] Deep Frontier's radiation shading made clean water and badwater look almost black. Both now look exactly as in the base game. Restart the game after updating.
[*][b]Radioactive water[/b] shows as a clear, softer yellow, and irradiated ground shows its yellow-green veins.
[/list]

[h3]Shorter, clearer tooltips[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Every building description is now one or two short sentences:[/b] what the building is for and the one thing to know before placing it. Numbers the tooltip already shows (cost, power, workers, recipes) are no longer repeated, so tooltips are much smaller.
[*]The pipe note is one short line everywhere, for example "Pipes: valve set to Inlet."
[*]Clearer texts for the Deep Well, the Human Record Cache and the deep seams and veins.
[*][b]The new-game map notice[/b] now says what a map is missing, what it affects and what to do about it, and that you can still finish the game.
[/list]

[h3]Smaller buildings, first batch[/h3]
Buildings now sit much closer to vanilla Iron Teeth scale. Recipes, workers and power are unchanged.
[list]
[*][b]Grocery Store[/b] 5x4 (was 9x6), [b]Fishery Works[/b] 6x5 (was 11x8), [b]Hospital[/b] 4x4, 4 high (was 4x9, 9 high), [b]Bathhouse[/b] 4x4 (was 7x5).
[*][b]Fertilizer Works[/b] 4x3 (was 7x5), [b]Cryogenic Tank Farm[/b] 4x4 (was 7x6), [b]Steel Mill[/b] 5x4 (was 8x6).
[*][b]Deep Mine[/b] 5x5 (was 7x6): it now covers its Deep Ore Vein exactly.
[*][b]Cement Kiln[/b] 3x3, [b]Concrete Mixer[/b] 3x2, [b]Stone Crusher[/b] 3x3, [b]Sandstone and Limestone Pits[/b] 3x3.
[*][b]Radioactive Waste Refinery[/b] 5x5 (was 9x7), [b]Radioactive Waste Vault[/b] 5x5 (was 8x7), [b]Mission Control[/b] 5x5 (was 8x7).
[*]Some build costs shift a little to match the materials of the smaller models.
[/list]
[b]Existing saves:[/b] shrunk buildings keep their place. Existing Deep Mines move onto their vein when the save loads; reconnect the path to their new entrance. The doors of the Grocery Store, Mission Control and the Waste Vault moved, so re-lay their paths. Reconnect pipes on Cryogenic Tank Farms and Bathhouses (their pipe sockets moved). Flipped buildings may need their path moved too. The rest of the buildings get smaller in the next updates; the Nuclear Reactor and the "Plant" buildings keep their size.
